// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3157297451" "Archon Neville's story"
// DetailString :
"P2557626730" "When you defeated him, Archon Neville gasped: <br><br>'You may have defeated me, but you will never get your hands on Burkholder. His new Zenith Mech Man will tower over us all!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Blueprint1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3551861705" "Schematics"
// DetailString :
"P561719997" "This blueprint details the inner workings of a Zenith Mech Man's joints."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Blueprint2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P2018837815" "This blueprint contains many equations regarding the balance and movement of an enormous Zenith Mech Man. On the back is scribbled a desperate note: <br><br>'Help me, please! The Council will never let me go!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - FaberStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3726536721" "Dr. Faber's story"
// DetailString :
"P1325458619" "When you rescued Dr. Faber from the Council, she told you: <br><br>'Archon Burkholder is mad! He forced me to help him build an enormous Zenith Mech Man! You won't believe the size of it. And he plans to loose it on the city! You've got to stop him, heroes. Please! Or I'll never forgive myself! <br><br>A word of warning: don't trust that Ernesto Hess too far. He was on guard duty here a few nights ago. He didn't tell you that? I didn't think so. There's something sneaky about him."

