"P847257287" "If that note is to be believed, Archon Burkholder is holding some scientist in the facility I'm sending you to. It seems he needed a little help to bring his giant Zenith Mech Man to life. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go in and extract that scientist, {TaskForceName}.</a> Not just because it's the right thing to do. But also because they should have valuable information about the state of Burkholder's progress."
