"P1112605038" "You have information on the robots' planned attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2577736498" "Well done, well done. Now that we know where the attack is planned, I can get a response team to work. Of course, that doesn't mean your job's over. Not by a long shot. Uh uh, {TaskForceName}, you're going to have to go back."
// RandomFameString :
"P1512891077" "{TaskForceName}'s been doing a lot of sneaking around in that Council base! I wonder what they're on to?"

