// Dialog :
"P513047430" "Archon Sanders spat 'You want to know the Mech Man's weakness? Fine! I'll tell you!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P720910112" "You defeated the villains and learned the weakness of the giant Zenith Mech Man."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2179120172" "So, the giant Mech Man can be piloted only by Archon Burkholder. I should have guessed. Burkholder's the key, then, {TaskForceName}. We take him down, we take down his entire brilliant plot!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3655007171" "{TaskForceName}'s working in the shadows these days."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3295941174" "If the intel you got out of Sanders can be believed, Archon Burkholder is the only person who knows how to pilot the giant Zenith Mech Man. I guess that doesn't surprise me. The word around the base is that he's obsessed with robotics. He even volunteered for Maestro's crazy medical experiments, with the condition that he be given a robotic arm. <br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>What this means for us is simple: if you take out Burkholder, you take down his entire scheme.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2493191331" "Take out Archon Burkholder"
// SendOffString :
"P1817447317" "I'm counting on you to end this, heroes. You'd be surprised to know what's riding on this one."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1370740322" "Defeat Archon Burkholder"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3858677583" "You've got to defeat Archon Burkholder before he can activate the giant Mech Man!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2714644286" "In the presence of the giant Mech Man, even a hero such as you is awed."

