"P567968966" "You defeated Archon Burkholder and stopped the launch of the giant Zenith Mech Man."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2643779984" "Archon Burkholder has escaped!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2953715270" "You stopped Archon Burkholder. Good work. I'll call in some friends to begin dismantling the giant Mech Man. I'm sure we can learn a lot from it. Thank you, {TaskForceName}. Thank you. Your service has been invaluable to me and my associates. You've kept the Council from growing too strong at a time when we could not afford it. <br><br>Who are my associates? Well, that's a story best left for another time. But rest assured, they can spin a tangled web."
// RandomFameString :
"P675269541" "{TaskForceName} stopped a giant robot attack!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2049196048" "I'll call in some friends to begin dismantling the giant Mech Man and tracking down Burkholder. You didn't stop him from escaping, but I still have to thank you, {TaskForceName}. Your service has been invaluable to me and my associates. You've kept the Council from growing too strong at a time when we could not afford it. <br><br>Who are my associates? Well, that's a story best left for another time. But rest assured, they can spin a tangled web."
// RandomFameString :
"P845996953" "I swear I saw a giant robot head sailing away from Striga Isle yesterday. Really! I swear!"

